      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FAIRPLAY (7) has been freshened since he was forced to work in the Vicbred final but had been racking up the wins prior. Has the speed to go forward from this draw. Strong claims. SEATHESTARS (3) found winning form here last time, leading to score by 2.3m. Has won four of the five times he has raced over this shorter trip here. Draws well so could strike again. SCHWARZ (2) disappointed last time but is much better than that having come from the back line to score at Geelong prior. Draws well so worth another chance. JACCKA EVAN NZ (6) came from a similar barrier and beat SCHWARZ for an easy win here last time, his third success from four starts this time in. Strikes at 50 per cent at this shorter distance so is a player again. NEW SHUFFLE (9) might need some luck from the back row but should find this easier than recent attempts.",
